<title>NEW ZEALAND: Affco first half profit down 46 pct.</title>
<headline>Affco first half profit down 46 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr result to March 31.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    5.65 vs 10.46</p>
<p>Dividend carries nil cps imputation credit.</p>
<p>Pay date June 27</p>
<p>Reg date June 13</p>
<p>    Ex div   June 16</p>
<p>Note - Affco Holdings Ltd is a meat processor.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
